{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "ءَاتَيْنَا", "translation": "We gave"}, {"text": "مُوسَى", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "وَٱلْفُرْقَانَ", "translation": "and the Criterion"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "perhaps you"}, {"text": "تَهْتَدُونَ", "translation": "(would be) guided"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when We gave Moses the Scripture and criterion1 that perhaps you would be guided."}